%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
% Title: Thermal Model Order Reduction and Simulation (TherMOS)           %
% Topic: Power Electronics, Model Order Reduction                         %
% File: ps3Fit                                                            %
% Date: 08.05.2025                                                        %
% Author: Dr. Pascal A. Schirmer                                          %
